14:["$","section",null,{"className":"px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-ink/50 font-bold","children":"FAQ"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-ink","children":"常见问题"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 grid gap-4","children":[["$","details","1. 美国报税 TurboTax 和 FreeTaxUSA 哪个更适合留学生？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["1. 美国报税 TurboTax 和 FreeTaxUSA 哪个更适合留学生？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"这是一个常见深坑。TurboTax 和 FreeTaxUSA 主要面向 Resident (RA) 开发。对于 F1 前 5 年的 Non-resident (NRA) 同学，直接使用这些软件极易导致身份报错。如果你是 NRA，建议首选 Sprintax 等适配软件；如果你已满 5 年转为 RA，FreeTaxUSA 通常比 TurboTax 更划算（联邦税申报常年免费）。"}]]}],["$","details","2. 留学生使用 AI 工具（如 ChatGPT/Claude）辅助报税的方法和风险？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["2. 留学生使用 AI 工具（如 ChatGPT/Claude）辅助报税的方法和风险？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"AI 可以帮你快速理解 1042-S 等税表名词，但绝不能直接让它计算税额。AI 无法实时更新 2026 年的最细微税法变动（如具体的 Standard Deduction 调整），也无法准确判定你的 $5000 中美税收协定适用性。建议将 AI 作为“名词解释器”，操作请参考本站保姆级指南。"}]]}],["$","details","3. 既有 W-2 又有 1099 收入，留学生该如何联合报税？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["3. 既有 W-2 又有 1099 收入，留学生该如何联合报税？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"很多 OPT 同学既有校内工作 (W-2) 又有兼职/自雇 (1099-NEC)。F1 NRA 同学需注意，1099 收入涉及 Self-employment 范畴，需填写不同的附表（如 Schedule C）。漏报任何一份 1099 收入都极易触发 IRS 审计，建议在 1040-NR 中统一汇总申报。"}]]}],["$","details","4. 2026 年有哪些推荐的美国联邦税免费申报软件？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["4. 2026 年有哪些推荐的美国联邦税免费申报软件？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"对于 NRA 身份：几乎没有完全免费的商业软件，建议先看学校是否提供 Sprintax 免费码。对于 RA 身份：推荐使用 IRS Free File 平台，或者直接使用 FreeTaxUSA。本站也提供了针对 8843 表格的免费辅助工具。"}]]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29"]}]]}]}]
