25:["$","details","6. 为什么我的补税/退税金额和同学差异巨大？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["6. 为什么我的补税/退税金额和同学差异巨大？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"原因通常有三：1. 是否正确申报了 $5000 的中美税收协定（Treaty）；2. 是否存在 FICA 误扣（OPT 前五年免缴社保医保税）；3. 各州税法差异。例如加州不承认 $5000 协定，这会导致联邦退税多、州税补税多的情况。"}]]}]
26:["$","details","7. 美国州税（State Tax）低价甚至免费申报平台推荐？",{"className":"group rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white/90 p-5 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(244,185,200,0.2)] open:bg-brand-pink/5 transition-all","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":["7. 美国州税（State Tax）低价甚至免费申报平台推荐？",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform font-mono text-xl","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70 border-t border-brand-pink/10 pt-4","children":"州税通常是商业软件的额外付费项。RA 同学可以尝试 MyFreeTaxes 等公益平台。NRA 同学如果想追求“0 元方案”，最稳妥的方法是从州税务局官网下载 PDF 手填后邮寄。若想图省事，Sprintax 等软件提供州税加购服务。"}]]}]
